  "debrief": "Read a truth table row by row, write an AND for every row that should be 1, and OR them: a sum of products, the standard way to turn any table into gates. Majority voting is how aircraft and rockets survive a faulty sensor: three computers vote, and one wrong answer is simply outvoted."
